{"t":"Map1","p":"Map1","g":"Übersichten","html":"<div> <p>Als <b>Map1</b> bezeichnet man im <a data-w=\"Metin2\">Metin2</a>-Jargon die Startkarten der drei <a data-w=\"Reiche\">Reiche</a>.<br/> Die drei Karten sind zwar allgemein verschieden, gleichen sich jedoch völlig in Sachen <a data-w=\"Monster\">Monster</a>, <a data-w=\"NPC\">NPCs</a>, <a data-w=\"Metin\">Metins</a> und <a>Erzadern</a>. </p><p>Bei Map1 unterscheidet man zwischen: </p> <ul><li><b><a data-w=\"Joan\">Joan</a></b> (<a data-w=\"Chunjo\">Chunjo-Reich</a> <img alt=\"Flag yellow.png\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/f/fd/Flag_yellow.png/28px-Flag_yellow.png\" width=\"28\"/>)</li> <li><b><a data-w=\"Pyungmoo\">Pyungmoo</a></b> (<a data-w=\"Jinno\">Jinno-Reich</a> <img alt=\"Flag blue.png\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/a/a8/Flag_blue.png/28px-Flag_blue.png\" width=\"28\"/>)</li> <li><b><a data-w=\"Yongan\">Yongan</a></b> (<a data-w=\"Shinsoo\">Shinsoo-Reich</a> <img alt=\"Flag red.png\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/a/a1/Flag_red.png/28px-Flag_red.png\" width=\"28\"/>)</li></ul> <table> <tbody><tr> <td><div><div><img height=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/e/e3/Joan_2.jpg/230px-Joan_2.jpg\" width=\"230\"/> <div>Mobkarte <a data-w=\"Joan\">Joan</a></div></div></div> </td> <td><div><div><img height=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/6/6d/Pyungmoo_2.jpg/230px-Pyungmoo_2.jpg\" width=\"230\"/> <div>Mobkarte <a data-w=\"Pyungmoo\">Pyungmoo</a></div></div></div> </td> <td><div><div><img height=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/8/85/Yongan_2.jpg/230px-Yongan_2.jpg\" width=\"230\"/> <div>Mobkarte <a data-w=\"Yongan\">Yongan</a></div></div></div> </td></tr></tbody></table> <div> <table> <tbody><tr> <td><img 